# Ours
.*
*.json
!.github/
!.github/**
# The blanket `.*` above hides every *new* dotfile, which is how .editorconfig and
# .gitattributes were invisible to `git status` until they were exempted by name.
# The other two are already tracked; they are listed so the next one cannot be
# added and silently ignored.
!.clang-format
!.editorconfig
!.gitattributes
!.pre-commit-config.yaml
!.vscode/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/mcp.json
!.claude
!.mcp.json
.github/claude/settings.local.json
*.log
*.log_*
logs_*
tests/acceptance/logs
*.patch
!patches/**/*.patch
!ecosystem/**/*.patch
*.diff
*.yuv
*.h264
*.pcapng
*.pcap
*.raw
*.dat
html/
test.*
build/
out*
assets/
*.pkg
*.jxs
